      "post": {
        "summary": "Mark a moment as known-good",
        "tags": [
          "Changes"
        ],
        "description": "Requires `graph:read`. Saying something looked fine at a given time\nis an observation anyone on the team can make, and a checkpoint only\never narrows a later search — a wrong one costs a wasted round, not\na wrong answer.",
        "requestBody": {
